                                                "sense_id": "6601aa20-acd3-3101-ada6-a9b5f60b42c3",
                                                "text": "As one of the results of these systems we have agrarian rule in nearly all the federated states of Germany."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5a4acbf6-6c22-33fe-9bcd-b056eefc5de7",
